Static-Built-Using: ${misc:Static-Built-Using}
Description: OWASP Coraza web application firewall, C library
 Coraza is a web application firewall engine written in Go that reads
 ModSecurity's rule language (SecLang) and runs the OWASP Core Rule Set.
 This library exposes the engine to C, for connectors such as the Nginx
 module in libnginx-mod-http-coraza.

Package: libcoraza-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libcoraza1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: OWASP Coraza web application firewall, C development files
 Coraza is a web application firewall engine written in Go that reads
 ModSecurity's rule language (SecLang) and runs the OWASP Core Rule Set.
 This package holds the header coraza/coraza.h and the libcoraza.so link,
 to build a connector against the library.
